.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-ci-slow-needed 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-ci\-slow\-needed \- Decide whether a diff can move the slow tier, so a diff that cannot does not pay for it
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten ci slow\-needed\fR [\fB\-\-head\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-base\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Decide whether a diff can move the slow tier, so a diff that cannot does not pay for it
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-base\fR \fI<base>\fR
The revision this checkout is diffed against
.TP
\fB\-\-head\fR \fI<head>\fR
The revision whose tree the checkout must carry; refused when it does not
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
